node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
.env
*.log

# The packed web build, produced by `npm run bundle` from the web app in
# `../src`. Generated, never committed — but it MUST exist before a build or
# the wrapper ships with no app inside it. `.easignore` is what keeps
# it in the EAS upload; CI regenerates it (see .github/workflows/native.yml).
assets/webroot.zip

# Generated by `expo prebuild`. Regenerated from app.config.js and the config
# plugins in `plugins/`, so it is the source of truth for nothing.
#
# LEADING SLASHES ARE LOAD-BEARING: a bare `ios/` matches at EVERY level, and
# this tree has `modules/icloud-store/ios` — hand-written Swift. Without the
# anchor the native half of the iCloud bridge is silently never committed, and
# the app builds without it.
/ios/
/android/

# Store credentials — never committed.
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
play-service-account.json
